    "description": "You hold up a fractured mirror to the target, and in that mirror it sees a thing that may yet come to pass—a ghastly foretelling that the target instinctively knows is eerily possible. It's not a guaranteed thing, just a dreadful possibility, but it haunts the target's thoughts all the same. . Critical Success The target is unaffected. Success The target is Slowed 1 and Stupefied 1 for 1 round. Failure The target is slowed 1 and stupefied 1 until it next gets eight hours of rest. Critical Failure The target is Slowed 2 and Stupefied 2, decreasing these conditions by 1 for each eight hours of rest it gets.",
